{
  "summary": "The RNA-only model using PCA encoding (pca_n2000) with single-profile settings achieved validation accuracy of 0.485 and F1 of 0.464, establishing a baseline for RNA-based approaches. This initial observation isolates the effect of RNA encoding without multimodal integration, but the performance relative to potential multimodal configurations remains uncertain. Further experiments are needed to evaluate the impact of image modalities or alternative encoding strategies."
}

